                                                "sense_id": "836a53fc-7dc9-356d-90da-4ff983e5c0a5",
                                                "text": "The acting CFO of Freddie Mac has been found dead in his basement, an apparent suicide. He's one of the executive team who has been clashing with regulators over how much to disclose about the ways the government has been running the company for its benefit, rather than that of the shareholders."
                                            },
