                                                "sense_id": "836a53fc-7dc9-356d-90da-4ff983e5c0a5",
                                                "text": "A new study from S&P Global Market Intelligence found that public companies with women CEOs or CFOs often were more profitable and produced better stock price performance than many of the companies that had appointed men to those roles."
